Package: origin
Title: Forward-Time Simulation of Lineage-Recording Cell Populations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aaron", "McKenna", email = "aaronatwpi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates growing cell populations that carry lineage recorders and
    replays recorder state along the resulting lineages. Populations come from a
    continuous-time Gillespie engine or from an imported PhysiCell division
    history. Recorders include base-editing and nuclease barcode arrays, prime
    editing, PALINCODE, mitochondrial genomes with heteroplasmy, and
    extrachromosomal DNA. Outputs are ground-truth trees plus the character and
    sequence matrices used to reconstruct them.
